Safe control, COUNT=100: gp_camera_init rc=0, list_files rc=0 count=100.
Fixed control remains the committed harness result (fixed pin returns -3,
no oversized read); no fixed rebuild was needed for this layout claim.

Disposition: the measured real build has NO natural pointer in the 464-byte
:154 destination window at the moment of the write -- only the top-chunk
size field and zeroed wilderness. Later allocations carve that memory and
write their own metadata/data, and free() writes tcache links after the
overflow. Device bytes can therefore corrupt the top size (an availability
abort), but steering a pointer still needs a probe-supplied address or a
lab-placed victim (W170-W172); W168's outside-grooming failures agree.
Lane CLOSED for this build/config, not generalized to every allocator state.
Grade unchanged: author-side unwitnessed rung 4 scopes, rung 5 UNKNOWN.
